  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn, if you have no cards in your
    other Pendulum Zone: You can place 1 Pendulum Monster from your Deck in your
    Pendulum Zone.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \n2 Level 7 Dragon-Type monsters\r\nIf you
    can Pendulum Summon Level 7, you can Pendulum Summon this face-up card in your
    Extra Deck. If this card in the Monster Zone is destroyed: You can place it in
    your Pendulum Zone. If this card is Xyz Summoned using an Xyz Monster as Material,
    it gains these effects.\r\n\u25CF It can make a second attack during each Battle
    Phase.\r\n\u25CF Once per turn: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from it; destroy
    as many cards your opponent controls as possible, and if you do, this card gains
    200 ATK for each, until the end of this turn."
